{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1320502001:1":{"text":"あのワンちゃん……羊さんをこっちに誘導だけして、どこかに行っちゃいましたよ！？てっきり牧羊犬かと思ったのですが。","source_cn":"那只狗……它怎么把羊赶到我们身边之后就跑了？！满满还以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAA78F9FF2183EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320502002:1":{"text":"牧羊犬で合ってると思うわ。","source_cn":"满满，它应该就是牧羊犬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF96D2CB3C0520C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320502003:1":{"text":"『ブライト風土記』で読んだことがあります。冬が長く厳しいスノーシダー町では、羊の飼育をしてる家庭が多くあって、そのほとんどで牧羊犬が飼われてるそうです。","source_cn":"我记得《耀光风土图鉴》上说，雪松镇天气寒冷，冬季也格外...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE427CA441CAF770A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320502004:1":{"text":"私たちに羊を飼い主のもとに誘導してほしい、ということでしょうか？","source_cn":"或许它是希望我们能带这只羊找到主人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA996D46F0A211A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320502005:1":{"text":"でも、どうして自分でしないのだろう？ロンロンたちは飼い主の居場所さえ知らないのに。","source_cn":"……它为什么不自己找？我们又不知道它们的主人在哪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1AC0BF6E47D515C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320502006:1":{"text":"他の羊を探してるのかもしれませんね。羊がこの一匹だけとは限りませんから。","source_cn":"唔，大概是去找其他绵羊了吧？毕竟牧民不可能只有一只羊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55812869DB2A5B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320502007:1":{"text":"とりあえず、付近で<style=\"highlight\">羊の飼い主</style>を探しましょう。ここに放っておくわけにもいきませんから。","source_cn":"先在附近找找<style=highlight>这只羊的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA003571D91B5356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}